  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - Mayai Poa- Egg Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We aim at up scaling our production by capitalizing on the use of modern chicken rearing techniques and tools. This will specifically include the use of modern cages, sourcing quality day old chicks, use of better feeds, better bio- security, better management and use the availability of nutritious raw materials such as Soya, amino acids, vitamins, phosphates, enzymes and better farming techniques. The expansion of egg production will ensure availability of nutritious food together with the manure to the community in Arusha and provide employment to the youth who are currently faced with unemployment.</narrative>
  </description>
